"(The book inside is labeled ""Ingredients for Preparation"" and is a hefty tome with pages visibly worn at the edges. It is unclear if it's a book of recipes or components for rituals.)",
"(The book is water-damaged and nearly all of the ink is smudged, but there are noticeable markups and doodles in the various page margins in smudges of differently colored ink. Whoever owned this was doing their own in-depth research.)",
"(The book seems to contain page after page of asuran love poems. You take a moment to read one.)

Oh, to be the bolt to your wrench
That the torque of your soul might apply to me!
Oh, to be a cog in the gear train of your heart
That I might help convey your energy!

(You conclude that this is unlikely to lead anywhere useful.)",
"(The edges of the document are singed.)

Sandtooth—five silver, merc work

Alistair—eight silver, protection from freebooters

Dexter—nine silver, protection from Hullgardeners

Jana—ten silver, skimmer rescue

Prudence—thirteen silver, body disposal

Axol—ten silver, weapon repairs

(The name keeps shifting. You can't make out what it says.)—five silver, private ledger access",
"(The eggs within are unlike any you've seen elsewhere, including here on Castora. They seem perfectly preserved, but someone kept them locked away for a reason, and you're left to wonder if it might be better that way.)",
"(The following is a rhyming game played by the children of Echovald. One child puts on a blindfold while the others link hands in a circle. The blindfolded child spins in a circle with a stick in hand, leading the chant. At the end, they rip off their blindfold and tackle the child the stick points at.)

Urgoz comes at night, night, night...

To give us all a fright, fright, fright!

Don't break a branch or stomp a shrew...

Or Urgoz will break you, you, you...

Urgoz...will...break...you!",
"(The inscription on the tomb has been worn away by time, but a few segments remain legible.)

""For those honored souls lost in the rite of Divitium Nava...""

""...fallen on the doorstep of divinity.""

""Blessed Ancora that lifts...""

""They have fallen, that we might ascend.""

(You cannot make out anything else.)",
"(The label is smeared with blood.)    
  
**Specimen**: Larva Coleoptera  
**Origin**: Castora  
**Age**: Estimated Three Days Old  
**Solution**: Saline and Formaldehyde",
"(The paper is water damaged and torn. The text is nearly illegible.)

Thank you for purchasing the Mr. Quiggles Fun in the Sun Accessory Pack! This bundle of delightful add-ons contains everything you need to vacation in style with your Mr. Quiggles Quaggan Toy. Whether you're teaching him to swim*, helping him achieve the perfect tan**, or building sand castles with him***, this accessory pack is certain to make your trip a memorable one. Have fun!

*Mr. Quiggles is not waterproof, waveproof, saltproof, or chemicalproof.

**Do not allow Mr. Quiggles extended time in direct sunlight.

