"(There is a letter atop the gold pile.)

Hedda,

I think they're on to us. I'm moving the organs around as subtly as I can, but that Lionguard is asking questions. And now she's got some patsy working for her. Please reach out once you get this letter. I'm not sure what to do, Boss. I'm worried that Isla will stop responding to the threats as well. You may need to put the screws to her to keep her cooperating.  

—Saturninus

