Let this further certify the application for the renaming of HYEOKSIN JADE to XUNLAI JADE CORPORATION, an entity for the mining and production of jade-related technology.

Signatories,
PARK CHUL-MOO and YU JOON, HYEOKSIN JADE
LUEN AI, XUNLAI GUILD OF CANTHA

Certified in the honorable presence of
