"<br><br>A necromancer's closest companion is death. In acknowledgement of this, I mark my face with the symbol of a ghostly wraith.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>A necromancer's closest companion is death. In acknowledgement of this, I mark my face with the symbol of a skull.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>A necromancer's closest companion is death. In acknowledgement of this, I mark my face with the symbol of a trickster demon.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I grew up among the nobility, and I value my honor.",
<br><br>I listen to my intuition and instinct in dangerous situations.,
<br><br>I look out from behind a mask of fanged dread.<br><br>This is my story.<br>,
"<br><br>I mean business. I'm the bruiser, the muscle, the bear you don't want to poke. My headband keeps my vision clear, no matter how physical I get. <br><br>This is my story.<br>",
<br><br>I rely on cunning to protect myself and my allies.,
"<br><br>I was raised by common folk, and I've done plenty of honest, hard work.",
<br><br>I watch the world from behind a mask of sorrow.<br><br>This is my story.<br>,
<br><br>I work hard to maintain my physical strength and prowess.,
<br><br>I'm a guardian. I have the helm and the curiosity of a visionary.<br><br>This is my story.<br>,
<br><br>I'm a guardian. I wear the armor and have the aspirations of a conqueror.<br><br>This is my story.<br>,
<br><br>I'm a guardian. I wear the pauldrons and bear the burden and loyalties of a fanatic.<br><br>This is my story.<br>,
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a bear that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a devourer that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a dog that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a drake that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a moa that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a raven that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a snow leopard that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a stalker that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a ranger, and I have a wolf that fights at my side and guards my back.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a warrior, and I wear a spangenhelm on the battlefield. Because of this, I am nearly invulnerable.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a warrior, and I wear an open-faced galea on the battlefield. Because of this, my enemies will remember who defeated them.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm a warrior, and I wear no helm on the battlefield. Because of this, my enemies falter when they see the fearless determination in my eyes.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an elementalist, and I study all the elements. I wear a gem that symbolizes my love of air.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an elementalist, and I study all the elements. I wear a gem that symbolizes my love of earth.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an elementalist, and I study all the elements. I wear a gem that symbolizes my love of fire.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an elementalist, and I study all the elements. I wear a gem that symbolizes my love of water.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an engineer, and you'll never find me without my eagle-eye goggles at hand.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an engineer, and you'll never find me without my panscopic monocle handy.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>I'm an engineer, and you'll never find me without my universal multitool pack at hand.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
<br><br>I'm an expert at subtlety and intrigue. A drawn hood lets me blend into the crowd.<br><br>This is my story.<br>,
<br><br>My first invention was a transatmospheric converter,
<br><br>My first invention was an infinity ball,
<br><br>My first invention was the VAL-A golem,
"<br><br>My people are dirt poor, and I've struggled all my life.",
"<br><br>My talents lie in the arts of stealth, infiltration, and escape. I do not draw attention to myself. To guard my identity, I hide my face behind a mask of darkness.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>The Pale Tree awakened me during the Cycle of Dawn, and",
"<br><br>The Pale Tree awakened me during the Cycle of Dusk, and",
"<br><br>The Pale Tree awakened me during the Cycle of Night, and",
"<br><br>The Pale Tree awakened me during the Cycle of Noon, and",
"<br><br>They tell me my sire is a loyal soldier. I plan to live up to his reputation, whatever it takes.",
"<br><br>They tell me my sire is a sorcerous shaman. I must overcome his reputation, whatever it takes.",
"<br><br>They tell me my sire is an honorless gladium. I have no respect for him, and I refuse to live in his shadow.",
"<br><br>To the world, I'm never without my harlequin's smile.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>When I fight, I use the mist scrim to focus my inner sight.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>When I fight, I use the resplendent curtain to block out the physical world in style.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>When I fight, I use the veil piercer to punch through the barriers that conceal the unseen.<br><br>This is my story.<br>",
"<br><br>While in my Dream, I dreamed about the Shield of the Moon, and I'm called to find it.",
"<br><br>While in my Dream, I dreamed of the Green Knight, and I'm called to find him.",
"<br><br>While still in my Dream, I dreamed of the White Stag, and I'm called to find it.",
