"<c=@Flavor>""Business is life, and life is good!""<br>—Anonymous Vabbian Trade Official</c>",
"<c=@Flavor>A flavorful sauce made from ground needles, from a recipe invented by the choya.</c>",
<c=@Flavor>A traditional style that has lasted for millennia.</c>,
"<c=@Flavor>Amidst the mighty cries of dragons, silence is deafening.</c>",
"<c=@Flavor>During the rebellion against the Flame Legion, charr renegades fashioned weapons from common military surplus, with very effective results.</c>",
<c=@Flavor>Following an unjust law is neither lawful nor just.</c>,
"<c=@Flavor>For some destinations, the best guide is one who's never completed the journey.</c>",
<c=@Flavor>It is the uncivilized beasts who hold neither spite nor guilt.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>Mercy may not be pleasant.</c>,
"<c=@Flavor>Neither light nor heat can be held, but both can be felt.</c>",
<c=@Flavor>Nothing is more desirable than what you do not have.</c>,
"<c=@Flavor>Now imbued, the depth of the gem draws your eye with imperial authority.",
<c=@Flavor>Proceeds donated to Extra Life!</c>,
<c=@Flavor>The Elon Riverlands are home to generations of traditional artisans.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>The citizens of Vabbi are known for their use of exquisite cosmetics.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>The gem now gives off a fiery luminescence and fills your palm with warm light.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>The inclusions in this gem look like swirling water.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>The same hands that make the pattern also unmake it.</c>,
"<c=@Flavor>The sapphire seems to change color as it moves, shifting through vivid earthy patterns. </c>",
<c=@Flavor>The spices mix with the ground Jacaranda Bloom to provide a hypnotizing aroma.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>These boots override leg armor.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>These gleaming metal scales earned their nickname because they are flexible but remain true and whole under great strain.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>This gem makes the air around it shimmer with color.</c>,
<c=@Flavor>What illuminates may also blind.</c>,
