"<c=flavor>""For a young one, you can't go wrong with a quaggan plush. They're perfectly squishy and huggable!""</c>",
"<c=flavor>""For the millionth time, there are no culinary applications for bloodstone dust. None.""<br>—Chef Robertus</c>",
"<center>%str1%: ""And Braham's bow.""</center>",
<center>Aurene: And the world would not survive it.</center>,
<center>Aurene: But you must use it.</center>,
"<center>Aurene: Go, Champion! You must reach Joon! She's the only hope we have!</center>",
<center>Aurene: No more questions. Go!</center>,
"<center>Aurene: No! I'll buy you some time, Champion...</center>",
<center>Aurene: Soo-Won! Please! You must fight it!</center>,
<center>Aurene: The other Elder Dragons...? You were their...</center>,
"<center>Aurene: Then what happens now, Soo-Won?</center>",
"<center>Aurene: They're not just ""mortals."" They're my friends.</center>",
"<center>Aurene: Yes, but...not with all of this inside her... It would unleash the Void onto the world...""</center>",
"<center>Bangar Ruinbringer: ""There's a whole world out there that wants to keep us down. And you know what they have on their side? An Elder Dragon.""</center>",
"<center>Eparch: And finally she brings herself before the throne. I've been waiting, princess of traitors.</center>",
<center>Eparch: Kneel. Sacrifice yourself to me. As you forced your queen to do.</center>,
<center>Eparch: Labris was right to refuse negotiations with you.</center>,
<center>Eparch: You will kneel. Or my generals will make you kneel. Your strength is mine. And my strength is the lifeblood of the Kryptis.</center>,
<center>General Zantharon: Speak your last words.</center>,
"<center>Peitha: Gorging yourself while we cut our way through your defenses? Bold strategy, ""King.""</center>",
<center>Peitha: Was the queen your strategist? Perhaps without Labris—</center>,
<center>Queen Labris: I have the strength. Eparch has the strength. You? An upstart demonling with a cast-off traitor fawning at your side?</center>,
<center>Queen Labris: Is there no limit to your arrogance? You believe yourself savior?</center>,
<center>Queen Labris: No. You would lead us to extinction. I will not allow it.</center>,
"<center>Queen Labris: The strength of will. To do that which needs doing, no matter the cost.</center>",
<center>Queen Labris: You have no idea the commitment required to ensure the survival of our people.</center>,
"<center>Rytlock: ""There's Ryland!""</center>",
<center>Soo-Won: Commander... Why haven't you...done what needs to be done.</center>,
<center>Soo-Won: Consider what I've said...</center>,
"<center>Soo-Won: Now you take my place, little one.</center>",
<center>Soo-Won: THE CYCLE IS ENDING!</center>,
<center>Soo-Won: THERE IS NO SOLUTION.</center>,
<center>Soo-Won: THERE IS NOTHING LEFT TO FIGHT.</center>,
<center>Soo-Won: WE WILL NOT BE UNDONE.</center>,
<center>Soo-Won: You must...find a way to end this...before...before...</center>,
"<center>Unknown: I thought my children would bring balance and harmony to the fabric of magic, but...</center>",
"<center>Unknown: Mm. I was imperfect, you see. Attuned to water, but not the other elements.</center>",
"<center>Unknown: They're your flock. The shepherd watches, and protects, but she does so in solitude.</center>",
"<center>Unknown: When I...created the others, I thought...""I don't have to be alone anymore.""</center>",
"<i>In order to enter this raid encounter, you must have completed Chapter 5 of ""Bound by Blood.""</i>",
"<i>In order to enter this raid encounter, your squad leader must have completed Chapter 5 of ""Bound by Blood.""</i>",
