"A new year dawns on Kryta and its citizens! All Tyrians are invited to Divinity's Reach for festival activities, traditional celebrations, and cheer to start the year off in good spirits.

Show your prowess in the Celestial Challenge, firecracker lighting, or a festival race—or compete in the Dragon Ball arena and earn festive envelopes containing a variety of prizes. All proceeds from festival goods will be donated to support citizens displaced by recent events.

This year, we also welcome visiting dignitaries from Cantha, who are arriving to celebrate our shared traditions. We encourage the citizens and allies of Kryta to join in the celebration and reunite with our long-separated kin from across the seas!

May you and your loved ones find good fortune this year and in years to come!",
