Attention,
"Attention Heroes!
An extra bounty has been placed on meta-events throughout Tyria. Completing them before 10:00 a.m. Pacific Time (UTC-7) on Tuesday, June 11 will grant you extra Bonus Boxes of Goods. Additionally, if the community completes enough of these events, all participants will be granted bonus rewards. See Bonus Events in the Achievements tab of the Hero panel for more info. Participants will have until 10:00 a.m. Pacific Time (UTC-7) on June 25 to claim their community-goal rewards.
Happy hunting!",
"Attention Heroes!
To celebrate the seventh anniversary of Guild Wars 2, an extra bounty has been placed on champion-rank enemies fought in Central Tyria. Champions defeated before 10:00 a.m. Pacific Time (UTC-7) on Tuesday, August 27 in various regions of Kryta, the Shiverpeaks, Ascalon, the Maguuma Jungle, and Orr will grant you Champion Marks, which can be traded with Consortium officers in major cities for Bonus Boxes of Goods. Additionally, if the community defeats enough of these champions, all participants will be granted bonus rewards. See Bonus Events in the Achievements tab of the Hero panel for more info. Participants will have until 10:00 a.m. Pacific Time (UTC-7) on September 9 to claim their community-goal rewards.
Happy hunting!

<c=@warning>This event is not active in Lake Doric, the Bitterfrost Frontier, Dry Top, or the Silverwastes.<c=@warning>",
"Attention allies of the Tyrian Alliance!   
  
Numerous scouts have found evidence of Inquest experimentation around the forge. Not only have they attempted to recircuit the ""Stewards of Galdra"" to extract seer knowledge, but both Priory and Astral Ward survey teams have uncovered evidence of failed experimentation with seer weaponry. Seer weaponry is not to be trifled with and contains immense power, even in an unrefined state. If anyone uncovers additional information, please report it to Tribune Rytlock at once.",
"Attention!

Are you enthralled by the marvels of jade tech?

Do you have a keen intellect and a burning curiosity about the world?

Are you eager to push your nation to a brighter, more innovative tomorrow?

If you answered yes to any of those questions, you may be qualified to participate in a paid vocational study with Xunlai Jade.

Don't miss this exciting opportunity to work with the latest and greatest innovations in jade tech. You've seen what Xunlai Jade can do for you, now let us see what you can do for Xunlai Jade!

*Volunteer applicants will undergo a comprehensive background check and must sign a nondisclosure agreement stipulating that they will not disclose any proprietary secrets divulged during their time with Xunlai Jade. Applicants must also sign a waiver of liability, releasing Xunlai Jade from any legal claims that may result from the injury, death, or dismemberment of applicants. Thank you!",
"Attention!

New and exciting recipes have been developed. Speak to me in Lion's Arch to learn more.

Legendarily yours,
Grandmaster Craftsman Hobbs",
"Attention, heroes!

An exciting new proposition in fractal research awaits, brought to you by the Consortium! For a limited time, recover Fractal Rush Trophies by stabilizing fractals via the Mistlock Observatory in Lion's Arch. Turn them in to our fractal researchers outside the Observatory for rewards and community goal progress. Additionally, if the adventuring community turns in enough trophies, all participants will be granted bonus rewards. Speak to your local coordinator for details.

Happy stabilizing!
—Assistant Subdirector Rannu",
"Attention, heroes!

An exciting new proposition in fractal research awaits, brought to you by the Consortium! For a limited time, recover Fractal Rush trophies by stabilizing fractals via the Mistlock Observatory in Lion's Arch. Courtesy of the Consortium's high-agility processes, your trophies will be automagically transferred to our vaults—and fantastic prizes will then be yours to claim based on your contribution! Speak to your local coordinator for details.

Happy stabilizing!

—Assistant Subdirector Rannu",
