"Boss,
You'll never guess who we saw the other day walking around Kaineng: our good friend Yao. Seems the kid has gotten themselves a job at Xunlai. You want I should take care of the situation?
Renho

***

No. Only watch and monitor.
Chul-Moo

***

You sure about that? Kid could spill a lot of our trade secrets. Better to get ahead of it than have to clean it up.
Renho

***

You have your orders. If Yao comes to any harm, the person responsible will see it returned—threefold. 
Chul-Moo",
