"Comman—Wayfinder!

R'tchikk would like to personally thank you for your assistance at the library. Skritt has been so desperately anxious preparing for skritt and Gladium's new roles as museum directors that R'tchikk could barely swing a sword against our Kryptis enemies. But, anytime R'tchikk gets an opportunity to witness the ever-opulent wayfinder's prowess in battle... Skritt just melts every time.

After you left, skritt found the strangest thing tucked away in one of Isgarren's hidden storages. R'tchikk really shouldn't be giving out Isgarren's belongings, but when skritt lifted the card it seemed to call for the wayfinder. Skritt wanted to send it, just in case.

Please be careful!
R'tchikk",
