"Cora said that joining the Aetherblades would boost our esteem. Finally get to travel, have a couple scuffles... Just a couple of city rats, seeing the world. Goin' on adventures, you know?  
  
Well, all I've done is scatter all of Scar's ""poems"" around this pit. The lady's got a good purpose—wants to make waves, takes care of business. But all we've done is play pranks and camp out in caves. Sure, we've gotten in a couple of bouts, but nothing seems to go our way. Morale is low.  
  
I mean, c'mon, ""Roses are red, the Pact commander is blue""? My little brother could've written that in his sleep. What're you trying to do, Scar, scare 'em out of their boots?",
