Dichotomy,
"Did he simply turn and go, disillusioned,",
"Did you know Desolation Fever could be cured with naught but specially prepared sentient root? Are you aware that you can comfortably sustain a family of five with a simple combination of common household products? Of course not, because Joko doesn't WANT you to know!

In this book, I'll share with you 101 things that Palawa Joko and his corrupt Mordant Crescent would prefer remain secret. These simple ingredients for greater health, wealth, and success were formerly restricted to the royalty of Vabbi, but now they can now be yours! We stand by our products and guarantee* your complete satisfaction!

*Guarantee not valid for residents of Vabbi, Kourna, Istan, or other outlying areas of Elona. Neither the author of this book, nor its publisher, are responsible for any imprisonment and/or executions that result from possession of this book, nor can they be held liable for any deaths or injury that result from the recipes therein.",
"Did you know that crimson sunflowers are native to Shing Jea? They grow in some meadow near Zen Daijun. To think, something so beautiful could flourish in such a...hostile place. Yuhwa told me that. She travels there every spring to pick 'em herself. Says they're her most popular flower. Go figure.

It's strictly for the sake of the job—getting to know her, I mean. After a week of watching the shop, I didn't see anything too scandalous. Decided to scope out the place for myself and went in. It smelled like orchids and home cooking (she lives in a tiny apartment in the back). I left with a bouquet and a full stomach.

She's kind. Definitely doesn't feel like a Jade Brotherhood heiress. I could be wrong, but...",
Did you know that you can exchange gold for gems and vice versa? Within the Black Lion Trading Post you can click on the Currency Exchange tab and swap your currencies!,
Did you know you can convert gems to gold and gold to gems at the Black Lion Trading Company?,
"Didn't you have to scale this Monument to have a skyscale egg experience acrophobia? Luckily, we took a small detour to look at some flowers.",
"Die Abtei Durmand verfügt über das Wissen, um Rissas Amulette aufzuspüren und zu zerstören, aber nicht über die Schlagkraft, um es auch wirklich zu tun. An dieser Stelle kommt Ihr und Euer neuer Orden der Wachsamen ins Spiel. Der entscheidende Endkampf mit Rissa steht bevor ... und ebenso die Antworten nach dem Schicksal von Jaul dem Dreisten.",
"Die Abtei Durmand verfügt über das Wissen, um Rissas Amulette aufzuspüren und zu zerstören, und das ist einer der Gründe, warum Ihr Euch ihnen dauerhaft angeschlossen habt. Der entscheidende Endkampf mit Rissa steht bevor ... und ebenso die Antworten nach dem Schicksal von Jaul dem Dreisten.",
"Die Abtei Durmand verfügt über das Wissen, um Rissas Amulette aufzuspüren und zu zerstören, und während sie dies tut, verlässt sie sich auf den Schutz durch die Wachsamen. Euer neuer Orden, der Orden der Gerüchte, misstraut den anderen, also steht Ihr bereit, um es zu Ende zu bringen, falls sie versagen. Der entscheidende Endkampf mit Rissa steht bevor ... und ebenso die Antworten nach dem Schicksal von Jaul dem Dreisten.",
