Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A bottle of liquid found near a fallen explorer in Orr. The origin of the beverage is unknown.,
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A combination of magic and science has created a collection of foods that never spoil. The package reads: ""Hey, it's better than starving.""",
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A crystal clear potion made from mountain snow by Snow Leopard shamans. It somehow chills and warms at the same time.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A potion made from kelp and other mysteries of the deep. It is rumored that consuming this helps the quaggan go berserk when provoked.,
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A savage concoction created by Wolf shamans, this is guaranteed to make you howl.",
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A special Canthan recipe. Centuries old.,
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>A spiced, smoky concoction. Raven shamans make this, but nobody knows where or how.",
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>Brewed from mystery ingredients found in the Toxal Bog—equal parts hearty meal and bug repellent.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>Don't ask what it's made of.,
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>It smells like paint thinner, but it sure seems to make the carnival worker who sold it to you happy...",
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>Made high in the Shiverpeak Mountains using a secret wurm-bladder filtration process...it's not for everyone.,
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>Only found in the Grove's social clubs, it's said this will make you move like a reed in the wind.",
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>The eldritch sextant.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>The finest cut of meat at Meatoberfest. The smell of its flame-roasted goodness makes it impossible to resist.,
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>The hottest, spiciest food in all of Tyria—it's guaranteed to make smoke come out of your ears...",
"Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>The kodans' favorite food. They're both strong and wise, so maybe they're onto something.",
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>The skritt have concocted a stew of mystery ingredients. It looks terrible but smells surprisingly appetizing.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>There's a faint whiff of something strange and powerfully concentrated. Drink this at your own risk.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>This Elonian water must be really old.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>This concoction smells strongly of dirt and axle grease. Hopefully this isn't why dredge are blind.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>This is a royal sigil belonging to Prince Rurik.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>This is an ancient Orrian artifact.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>This potent drink is only served at the Last Whiskey Bar. They say it can curl your whiskers.,
Double-click to gain a hero point.<br>This...food has an unfamiliar but tempting aroma. Probably best to eat it first and not ask questions.,
