"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>A report detailing Zojja's shutdown of the Inquest's runaway Prototype X golem, with some welcome assistance.<br><c=@flavor>""The Inquest are nothing if not demonstrably asinine.""<br>—Zojja</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>A report from the largest scale ghost assault in recent history. Tribune Rytlock Brimstone and a collection of crack soldiers expertly turned the tide of the battle.<br><c=@flavor>""We barely made it out alive.""<br>—Crista Sureshot, Blood Legion</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>A scorched book of enchantments used by the Flame Legion to prepare their effigies for battle.<br><c=@flavor>""Call the fire, call the flame.""<br>—Flame Legion Chant</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>An observer's guide to the proud and noble griffon. It contains information regarding these elusive and formidable creatures.<br><c=@flavor>"" So lovely... So majestic... So deadly!""<br>—Academy of Griffon Appreciation</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>An overview of the culture and history of the reclusive Tengu race.<br><c=@flavor>""May the wind be at your back""<br>—Swiftwing Family Motto</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>Based on current combat reports, this up-to-date manual will be released to all serving in the legions.<br><c=@flavor>""Didn't we already defeat them once?""<br>—Rytlock Brimstone</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>The fevered scrawlings of a pure madman. Only the first couple pages contain anything cogent, or legible, about the Shadow Behemoth.<br><c=@flavor>""My n-nightmares will never end.""<br>—Crazy Ivan </c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>These field notes overflow with eloquent prose that manages to obscure the vileness of these disease-carrying beasts.<br><c=@flavor>>""Truly the noblest of swamp creatures""<br>—Priory Scholar Gleev</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>These notes brim with information regarding the long-deplored, scarcely studied devourers, important predators in Tyria's rich ecosystem.<br><c=@flavor>""We believe the extra tail to be a recent adaptation, and feel we may one day find an elusive three-tailed species.""<br>—Devourer Preservation Society</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>This document describes the male norn clan known as the Sons Of Svanir, that worships the Ice Dragon.<br><c=@flavor>""We serve Jormag.""</c><br>Account Collectible",
Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>This frigid book is given to scholars entering the Shiverpeaks to better prepare them for the dangers they face.<br><c=@flavor>Caution: Cold </c><br>Account Collectible,
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>This song recounts one the greatest hunts of recent memory, for the great wurm Issormir.<br><c=@flavor>""That battle will be sung about for ages.""<br>—Eir</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>This tactical report describes the recent centaur assault on Shaemoor involving a giant earth elemental.<br><c=@flavor>""More than the lightning or the rocks, watch out for the flying cows.""<br>—Clerk Sanderson</c><br>Account Collectible",
"Double-click to gain a skill point.<br>Creature Codex<br>This tattered book is filled with battle-won insight into commonly-used Krytan bandit tactics.<br><c=@flavor>""Always go after the one with the bomb first.""<br>—Major Winters</c><br>Account Collectible",
