"Enclosed is your allotted share of the goods procured by our hunters. Another shipment will be sent tomorrow. You can always change your orders at your Black Lion Acquisitions Board.

—Black Lion Acquisitions",
"Enclosed is your candy-powered matter meter, developed by the Durmand Priory (inspired by the College of Statics).<br><br>Each meter is powered by candy corn. The elusive material has close ties to the Mad King's realm, which leaks over into Tyria at this time of year.<br><br>Using a kernel as a focus, you can scan four different frequencies: aqueous, gaseous, etheric, and corporeal. There are suspicious locations on all four frequencies, and it's up to you to discover them.<br><br>Try it with the little ghost standing right next to me. She's hiding behind an etheric veil, so use the etheric frequency!<br><br>You'll notice, on your journey, that each page from the Mad King's past contains clues on how to proceed. Pay close attention to these clues, for they are the only way you will piece together the past and complete our volume of Mad Memoires.<br><br>We're missing six stories. Now get moving! We only have so long before the energies of the Mad Realm vanish again!<br><br>—Magister Tassi",
"Enclosed is your yield from our ongoing assignments. Another shipment will be sent tomorrow. Remember, you can always change the locations your teams are gathering from at the Black Lion Requisition Teams Post in your home instance.

—Black Lion Requisitions Division",
