"Excelsior, adventurer! Lion's Arch is still abuzz with tales of the Lionguard's brave incursion into the lair of Tyria's latest villainous cadre, the Aetherblade Pirates—and now, you can experience the decisive raid for yourself!

That's right, in the Consortium's proprietary Fractals of the Mists, you can relive pivotal moments in Tyria's history within Mist-based simulacrum environments*. Fight alongside the Lionguard's own Inspector Kiel and become the tip of the spear as you break through the Aetherblade defenses and bring their leader to justice!

Fabulous experiences and exciting prizes await, in the Fractals of the Mists! Try it today in Lion's Arch!

—Your Friends at the Consortium

*Fractal recreations are not guaranteed to be precisely accurate to historic events. Terms and conditions apply; see attached adventurer agreement for details and an updated liability waiver.

(You received this message as a party of interest in events that have been identified as appearing in Fractal recreations. If you wish to unsubscribe from future Consortium offers and opportunities, please submit a notarized letter of disinterest (Form-3C-D2) to our Lion's Arch offices for processing.)",
