"If I was on the cliffs, I would be safe from any tidal waves that crashed on the Coast. It would be a disaster if you couldn't find any launch pads in time.",
"If I was participating in Hunger Royale, a Wild idea would be to hang around a potato farm.",
"If I were to condense
her life
into a moment,
a floating speck suspended
in the gallery of time,
where would I find her?

Would she be
the still frame 
of a child playing barefoot
in a shallow creek,
tossing the contents
of cupped hands
airborne?
Does she live in
bits of dry grass and
plucked hydrangea
floating overhead,
waiting to be pulled inward
in the soft gasp of summer?

Or maybe she is
the exhale of autumn,
echoing in brisk leaves
that scamper across
a dirt path.
Is she caught in an updraft
of warm reds and browns burnt
with just a tinge of orange?
Does she waft over
muddied footprints
as if she's extinguishing
a flame so fragile,
you might wonder
if it's there?

Maybe.

Yet,
I do not recognize her
in the freezing lungs of winter.
Not in the indifferent way it holds
its chilled breath
far longer than it should.
To me,
she doesn't look like
the icy lake or
the snow dancing over
chilled sand that piles
like white ash
beneath a fading pyre.
I refuse to see her in
the silhouette of life
frozen against
the nothingness of night.

No, she isn't that.

Instead,
I believe she may be
the first inhales of spring,
gifting existence in its blossoms,
tiny, imperceptible,
blooming like small rays of
the divine.
I feel her in the petals
of every lilac
born sacred in the dawn.
Here, I find comfort
watching her resurrected
in each moment
as a perfect being,
perfect in the way that
the final breath of summer
is sometimes
all we have
to last us until spring.",
"If Malyck is the ""Harbinger"" that the Nightmare Court seek, then you must keep him from their clutches. At all costs.",
"If North Nolan Hatchery falls to the Molten Alliance, it will disrupt the charr's war efforts.",
"If Razor gave you this message, it means we trust you with joining our operation against the Flame Legion. We need someone capable to strike at the Flame Legion, hassling them until we locate our high-value target. <br><br>Your mission: kill any Flame Legion personnel you find, and destroy any of their equipment, weaponry, or braziers. If you find any intel, deliver it to Razor. She'll get it to the right operative. And if any of you Flame kissers are reading this, we're coming for you.<br>
—VS",
"If Sergeant Hal knows something about the fall of Falcon Company, it was troubling enough that he requested a transfer. Hopefully, speaking to him will clear this up.",
"If Ventari's Tablet has not been summoned, summon it at your location; otherwise, gain tranquility. Grant boons to allies around the tablet. Gain energy depending on the number of allies affected by this skill (excluding yourself). For each point of affinity, boon duration is increased.",
"If checked, the key bind associated with ""Show Ally Names"" can be held down to display any hidden UI elements.",
"If checked, the key bind associated with ""Show Ally Names"" can be held down to show the mouse cursor with high contrast.",
"If dealing with plants isn't your style, Gentle Heron always has his hands full feeding the villagers. I think he'd appreciate assistance in making meals for the hungry.",
"If it wasn't for your brave efforts at Molitage Digs, our members may have failed to complete their research. With your help, the Priory learned valuable information about the battles between dwarves and destroyers. We thank you.

—Priory Explorer Leandra",
"If members of Falcon Company survived the centaur attack, they were likely sold to slavers by those beasts. Deborah could still be alive—and desperately in need of help.",
"If needed, remnants can be purchased from Ward Trader Sampaguita in Bava Nisos.",
"If needed, remnants of this item can be purchased from Lowland Shore renown heart vendors.",
"If needed, remnants of this item can be purchased from the renown heart vendor in Mistburned Barrens.",
If none of those sound appealing—or if you're just looking to train—there's sparring teachers at the arena who are always up for teaching and learning the best way to strike a foe.,
"If not careful, you can spend much longer staring into the open mouth of this empty jar than you had intended.

<c=@flavor>Grief, tortured and twisted, all too easily becomes thorned malice.</c>",
"If one is looking for the stars, there is only one bastion where they are found.",
"If one more Awakened informant reaches a raven post, the village dissenters will surely be reported.",
"If only magical barriers were as easy to maintain as waving a wand. It takes work and undying focus, and these barriers must not fall.",
"If some of the Falcons were taken prisoner, there may be survivors—including, possibly, your sister. Perhaps Captain Tervelan can assist your investigation.",
"If that's true, then we're Tyria's best hope to survive the darkness which is yet to come.",
"If the Ascalonian Catacombs feel too easy, try the explorable mode. It's more challenging and has greater rewards. (The story version must be completed first.)",
If this is your first experience with Guild Wars 2 we recommend trying the Human Demo to better understand the basics of the game.,
"If this item is already bound to your account and you have
not received a replacement box, please contact Customer Support.",
"If this option is checked, the walk key must be held down for the duration of walking. Otherwise, the walk key toggles between walk and run.",
"If we don't stop them, they'll turn Tyria into a burnt-out husk; a broken shell.",
"If you abandon this mission, all its progress will be lost.<br>Do you wish to proceed?",
"If you abandon this mission, it cannot be restarted for %num1% seconds.<br>Do you wish to proceed?",
"If you and your friends are looking for a challenge, visit the Ascalonian Catacombs dungeon in the Plains of Ashford. Check your mail for a map to the dungeon.",
"If you are not wearing a disguise in this area, you will be kicked out.",
"If you are running low on health, be sure to use your healing skill to replenish it!",
"If you are tracking a tier 2 or tier 3 rift, double-clicking will revert to tracking tier 1 rifts. Apply to tier 1 rifts to increase essence gains on closure.",
If you can't stand the heat...,
"If you find a spot you'd like to stay in, you can drop your anchor and walk around your skiff!",
"If you get lost, remember you can find important information here.",
"If you get stuck, you'll have to fight your way out.",
"If you have a skill set to <c=@Quest>auto-attack</c>, you will automatically use that skill until the enemy is defeated.

You can toggle auto-attack on a skill with <c=@Quest>CTRL + Mouse 2</c>. Do this by holding CTRL and selecting the skill with the right mouse button.",
"If you have enough funds for an item, it will be displayed as white text. Items you don't have enough funds for will be displayed in red.",
"If you have less than five supply, periodically replenish supply when leaving your base",
"If you have lost your boundary markers, this may help.",
"If you leave the marketplace, you will no longer be employed.",
"If you need additional help, you could ask Vigil Scout Premhoc. She probably has a good idea where you can find the items we need.",
"If you need help tracking down those artifacts, come see me at the Durmand Priory expedition camp. I can show you a map of where they're located.",
"If you need help, click the button below to contact our Customer Support team.",
"If you never climb, you'll never see the view from the top.",
"If you never run, you'll never see the end of the trail.",
"If you never walk, you'll never see all the scenery.",
"If you or your group leader has completed the battle for Flame Citadel and Senecus Castrum, you can now take on the Citadel of Flame dungeon in the Baelfire. Check your mail for more information.",
"If you see an enemy dolyak in the area, make sure you don't let it reach its destination.",
"If you seek to help us, fishing is the simplest and most enjoyable way. Mind you, we prefer the flavor of our land—local fish only, we ask.",
"If you swing by Leyspring Hollows, I'll be hanging out around here.",
"If you swing by Shipwreck Strand, meet me around here.",
"If you take damage greater than the health threshold in a single strike, you release feathers to blind nearby enemies and gain stealth.",
"If you use a skill with nothing targeted, the game will automatically select an appropriate target for you.",
"If you want to know more about disenchanting the warded artifacts, talk to me. And quickly, before they get us all killed.",
"If you're all right with backtracking a bit, there's a beautiful lake at the Bastion of the Natural. I hear there's been some Kryptis sightings in that area though, so I'd be careful.",
"If you're done being altruistic, we need you at the Snaff Prize! The College of Dynamics is counting on our Massively Impressive Golem (MIG) to win. Our demonstration is going to make the judges' heads explode in amazement...but only if you're here to help your krewe to victory. We're at Battleground Plaza...what are you waiting for? Get over here!
—Hronk, Genius",
"If you're looking for a new type of dungeon, try the Fractals of the Mists, accessible through the Fractals asura gate in Lion's Arch. The rewards improve as the difficulty rises.",
"If you're looking for ways to help us, Soaring Crest usually needs an extra hand tending to the infested crops over by the plant beds.",
"If you're new to Guild Wars 2—or could use a refresher—we've created a new player guide to help with those first steps into the world of Tyria. Click the button below to read it on our official website!

Happy adventuring,

The Guild Wars 2 Team",
"If you're not sure where to go next, check your map by pressing the [lbracket]M[rbracket] key. Green icons, arrows, and circles indicate where your next quest objective is.",
"If you're raring for a fight, take your friends to Caudecus's Manor in the Shire of Beetletun. Check your mail for the dungeon's location.",
"If you've explored the Realm of Dreams, you've likely experienced the terror of the spinegazer's stare; not only can it launch a barrage of ranged physical attacks, it also wages psychological warfare by planting tormenting visions in the minds of its enemies.—Acht",
"If you've lost the storybook, rejoice—you can always get it back from the cabin boy, Skippy!",
"If your held flame is extinguished, you can relight it from any previously lit torch pillar.",
"If your words don't change their hearts, stab them with the pointy end. 25%% chance to break.",
