Lion's Arch has been retaken!,
Lion's Arch has fallen to the armies of Scarlet Briar. Join the fight to retake the city and strike a blow against Scarlet's forces by defeating her Watchknight Triumvirate.,
"Lion's Arch is a big city—and yet somewhere, hiding beneath the surface, the Order of Whispers awaits you. Your first task is to track them down.",
"Lion's Arch is under attack! The Lionguard is attempting to secure rally points at Fort Marriner, Postern Ward and Trader's Forum. The Lionguard needs assistance in getting evacuees to safety out of the city and to refugee camps.",
"Lion's Arch, built upon the wreckage of the Krytan City of the same name, has grown and prospered in the years since the rise of the Orrian Dragon. Founded by pirates and dependent on trade, the city has become a common ground for all the races of Tyria.",
