List of White Mantle Hideouts,
"Listed below, at the time of writing, are the current Tyrian Alliance members and affiliates.  

Each party was welcomed to write introductions. As this alliance sets a historic precedent, it was important for us to record as many contributions as possible. As you will see later on, some introductions were made via spoken word and had to be transcribed and translated by experts from the Durmand Priory.

**Representing the Royal Nation of Kryta:** Queen Jennah  
**Additional Delegates:** Countess Anise, Minister Wi, and Ambassador Meade

**Representing the United Legions of Ascalon:** Imperator Crecia Stoneglow  
**Additional Delegates:** Imperators Malice Swordshadow, Efram Greetsglory, and Mia Kindleshot, and Proconsul Wade Samuelsson

**Representing Hoelbrak and the Northern Steadings:** Knut Whitebear  
**Additional Delegates:** Skarti Knutsson, Braham Eirsson, and Havrouns Ursel, Valda, Weibe, and Svena

**Representing Rata Sum and Metrica Province:** Councillor Ludo  
**Additional Delegates:** n/a

**Representing the Grove and Greater Astorea:** Dagonet  
**Additional Delegates:** Caithe and Aife  

**Representing the Free Port of Lion's Arch:** Commodore Lawson Marriner  
**Additional Delegates:** Captain Ellen Kiel, Captain Magnus the Bloody-Handed, and Captain Evon Gnashblade

**Representing Cantha:** Empress Ihn  
**Additional Delegates:** Navan, Minister Ishikawa, Eiko Broadcrest, Ayumi, and Choole

**Representing Elona:** Chief Councilor Imann  
**Additional Delegates:** Spearmarshal Zaeim, Elder Dorran, Boticca, and Ambassador Sianna

**Representing the Highland Sanctuaries:** Cresting Wave  
**Additional Delegates:** Deep Water and Cloudseeker

**Representing Harvest Den:** Stoic Alder  
**Additional Delegates:** Barbed Vale and Poised Arrow

**Representing the Dominion of Winds:** Kalidris Sparrowhawk

**Representing the Hylek Tribes:** Chief Tlatoa, Kaana Miatli, and Kaana Pahua

**Representing the Maguuma Centaur Tribe:** Ehrgen Cragstrider  
**Additional Delegates** Niiri Freemane

**Representing the Skritt Burrows:** Queen Chrii'kkt V, Skritt King LXXV, and Dawkkurra

**Representing the Ogre Kraals:** Chieftain Lagula, Chieftain Malik the Destroyer, and Chief Mognoll

**Representing the Quaggan Villages:** Varonos Narrijoo, Boudou, Doolbroo, Marlooga, Saszglop, and Neootek

**Representing the Deldrimor:** Ogden Stonehealer  
**Additional Delegates:** Enid Bronzebeard, Orozar Highstone, and Beryl Waylit

**Representing the Astral Ward:** Isgarren  
**Additional Delegates:** Lyhr, Dagda, Frode Wurmsbearer, and Uenno

**Representing the Pact:** Marshal Logan Thackeray  
**Additional Delegates:** Laranthir, Lightbringer Zrii, and Wynnet Fairhaired 

**Representing the Vigil:** General Jhavi Jorasdottir  
**Additional Delegates:** Laranthir, Ember Doomforge, and Warmaster Efut

**Representing the Order of Whispers:** Preceptor Doern Velazquez  
**Additional Delegates:** Preceptors Halvora Snapdagger and Valenze and Lightbringer Zrii

**Representing the Durmand Priory:** Steward Gixx  
**Additional Delegates:** Magisters Ela Makkay, Keadin, Archon Gilius, and Wynnet Fairhaired",
