"Mastery of tengu wind magic allows you to conjure the Cyclone Bow at will. Using arrow-consuming skills grants Wind Force. After you reach the Wind Force threshold, you are able to use Hawkeye. Gain access to <c=@abilitytype>Squalls</c>.<br><c=@reminder>Using Cyclone Bow skills consumes arrows. You generate arrows every interval.</c>",
"Mastery over Empowered Beehives, Bloodstone-Empowered Beehives, and Mistburned Beehives grants you additional bonuses.
<br>• Your warclaw gains a speed boost when interacting with a beehive. If you have the Blazing Speed Mushrooms Mastery trained, the effects and duration are improved.
<br>• Your mounts gain a brief Bond of Vigor effect. If you have the Rising Spirits Mastery trained, the duration is increased. 
<br>• Gain boons when interacting with beehives. If you have the Energy Efficiency Mastery trained, the boon durations are increased.",
"Mastery over the Horn of Maguuma has granted multiple bonuses:
<br>• Junior Archivist's Aide Conri can enhance Obsidian armor with a cosmetic upgrade! He can be found next to the Forge of Timelessness.
<br>• Gharr Leadclaw can exchange currency, materials, and more! He can be found west of Empyrean Plaza next to a thornsprout bloom.
<br>• Arcane chests take significantly less time to open.
<br>• You are able to reduce the rate of emotion stacks Eparch consumes.
<br>• Successful completions of the Into the Spider's Lair meta-event grant a daily reward that contains particularly rare items.",
