"Oh my! The Mad King is attempting to escape from his Mad Realm! If he isn't stopped, he could force his way into Tyria forever!",
"Oh, Kuda, how I long for the moment when you can finally see what I've seen all along: that we're meant to rule this world together, side by side. But I've always believed you'll see it eventually—that we synergize perfectly, that we're the solution to the problem.

The others merely comply with your wishes out of fear, but I alone see your brilliance for what it is. I alone understand that each experiment, each step forward, is an act of love for a world that doesn't deserve it. This world hates you for your genius, but I don't. I see the beauty in what you're doing.

That's why I know we'll be together in the end. We're the only ones who can see it. But they'll all see, someday. And then, they'll pay for doubting your vision.",
