"One of the lowlanders showed me to the local troll cave for an introduction between myself and the troll leader. Woken by Peace acted as my translator.  
  
I noticed a peculiar glow from the center of their cave; its iridescent shimmer immediately caught my eye. I didn't believe my initial instinct until I got closer and confirmed that instinct immediately. They'd somehow acquired a scale of Glint! I've seen one in person before—a gift to Isgarren from the crystal queen herself, though for what purpose he's never said.  
  
The one I found in the troll cave is encompassed by branches—perhaps it was here before they called this place home?",
"One of the most notorious symbols of norn/human relations to this date remains the Olafson Sword. The sword was gifted to the renowned Olaf Olafson at one of his many farmstead gatherings as a token of appreciation from newly settled humans in the area. After obtaining it, various sources have claimed that Olafson enchanted the sword so that it would serve as the only functioning key for a hidden vault in the region. Legend has it that Olafson placed his valuables in this vault as protection against the increasing number of looters (and suitors) in the area. In modern times, Olafson's remaining descendants and treasure hunters alike have searched for Olafson's supposed bounty. It has yet to be successfully recovered.",
