"The Black Lion Trading Company invites our loyal customers to join us in celebrating founder Evon Gnashblade's birthday! We're throwing our vault doors wide open for a full week to shower YOU with fabulous prizes.

Are dusty piles of old, unwanted materials cluttering up your new homestead? Our birthday manager is standing by at the Black Lion Vaults in Lion's Arch, ready to whisk them off your hands. In exchange, we're offering a selection of valuable Black Lion goods—handpicked by Captain Gnashblade himself.

It's an opportunity you can't afford to miss, and it usually only comes once a year!

—The Black Lion Trading Company",
