"The Lionguard has located a new Aetherblade stronghold inside Twilight Arbor. Captain Magnus's standing orders are to destroy any Aetherblade facilities we can find, but this is more than payback for the murder of Councillor Ashford—intelligence says those pirates still follow the mad villain Scarlet Briar and that they're gearing up for something big.<br><br>If you want to help shut down the Aetherblades before they carry out Scarlet's next bit of craziness, meet me at Twilight Arbor and I'll factor you in to the plan. Warden Idon is stationed in Caledon Forest outside Twilight Arbor. He can update you on the situation inside.<br><br>—Deputy Turma of the Lionguard",
The Lionguard have kindled a victory bonfire on Farshore Ward's beach.,
"The Lionguard have landed on Southsun Cove to launch a counterattack on the karka. All capable volunteers should report to the Transport Facilitator, who is standing by at the Sanctum Harbor docks.",
"The Lionguard have regrouped, and we are ready. With our allies from the Vigil, Durmand Priory, and the Order of Whispers, we will storm Lion's Arch, establish rally positions, cut down Scarlet's forces, and take the fight to Scarlet herself.

After a year of suffering, invasion, and death at her hands, we have Scarlet right where we want her. Come to Lion's Arch with your rage and your best weapons. Show no mercy to Scarlet and her damned followers. Today begins a battle that will be sung about for years to come. Fight alongside me as we take back our city and wipe Scarlet off the face of Tyria forever.

To battle!

—Captain Magnus the Bloody-Handed",
