"This potion is **NOT** for those who are looking for some sort of affection or love potion...that is, unless you're keen on your suitor trying to maul you to death. When this potion makes contact with the skin of any creature or subject, it will force their sweat glands to secrete fluids that will mix with the stimulant, attracting any non-sapient creatures nearby and causing them to become hostile toward them.  
  
INGREDIENTS:  
- Hylek poison (trust me) 
- Jar of bees (please don't drop it)  
- Fresh stomach (don't ask from where)  
- Spiky fruit",
"This potion must be kept at room temperature **at all times**. No exceptions unless you're eager to be rid of a leg. Keep stored within a well-ventilated and dehumidified area. Do not keep past expiration date noted on the bottom of the container, and do not jostle the container as the liquid inside is volatile. Most critically, under no circumstances can you drop this vial unless you're prepared to meet the Six (or whatever omnipotent being you may seek guidance from).  
  
