"Time to go back to work, Agent. Something is preying on the quaggans in Lake Wyrmblood, and from the looks of it, that something is the dragon's corruption. Meet me at the lake and we'll get to the bottom of it (get it?). Hey, I may not be handsome or brave, but I can quip with the best of 'em.
—Lightbringer Tybalt Leftpaw",
"Time to go to work, Agent. The Preceptors want us back in the field: a hylek tribe has been sacrificing its greatest warriors to a dragon minion. They don't realize the harm they're doing: every body they give it comes back as an undead. We have to stop them from harming themselves and helping the dragons. I've included their village's location. Meet me there and we'll sort this out.
—Lightbringer Tybalt Leftpaw",
