"Train this mastery to gain additional effects from Empowered Beehives, Bloodstone-Empowered Beehives, and Mistburned Beehives in Janthir.
<br>• Your warclaw gains a speed boost when interacting with a beehive. If you have the Blazing Speed Mushrooms Mastery trained, the effects and duration are improved.
<br>• Your mounts gain a brief Bond of Vigor effect. If you have the Rising Spirits Mastery trained, the duration is increased. 
<br>• Gain boons when interacting with beehives. If you have the Energy Efficiency Mastery trained, the boon durations are increased.",
"Train this mastery to gain bonus effects:
<br>• Add new services to the Wizard's Tower to upgrade Obsidian armor or to exchange various map currencies and materials.
