Using Skills,
Using a <c=@abilitytype>Beast</c> ability grants you offensive boons.,
Using a <c=@abilitytype>Deception</c> skill will create a clone if you have any other clones active.,
Using a <c=@abilitytype>consume</c> skill heals you.,
Using a <c=@abilitytype>morph</c> skill increases your damage for a duration.,
Using a <c=@abilitytype>shout</c> grants allies might. Granting an aura to an ally increases your outgoing damage for a period of time.,
"Using a <c=@abilitytype>virtue</c> skill recharges radiant weapon skills. Justice recharges hammer, Resolve recharges staff, and Courage recharges sword and shield.",
"Using a Chatoyant Elixir or similar effects, visit and pet a hidden cat.",
Using a chant reduces the recharge of your other chants and grants boons to affected allies.,
Using a deception ability removes revealed. Reduces recharge on deception skills.,
Using a heal skill grants might.,
Using a heal skill grants superspeed in a radius around you. Using a healing skill's associated tool-belt skill grants you personal superspeed.,
Using a heal skill triggers a cleansing pulse around you.,
Using a shatter skill removes a condition from you and allies around you.,
Using a signet skill reduces the recharge of all signet skills.,
"Using a stolen skill grants additional boons to allies around you. Stolen skills will always be Steal Time, regardless of the target's profession. <br>",
Using an elite skill summons a pool on the target enemy that inflicts poison and cripple. Pool duration scales with the recharge of the elite skill.,
