Vloxen Shards,
Vloxx has been defeated and he yields. You will be teleported back to Castora soon.,
Vloxx has returned and is vulnerable to attack!,
Vloxx was defeated!,
Vloxx was victorious.,
Vloxx's Coffer[s],
Vloxx's Magnificent Coffer[s],
Vloxx's Portal,
Vloxx's Vision,
Vloxx's presence in the depths has destabilized parts of the ley root. Clip and dispose of the unstable shoots properly.,
Vloxx: And they tore them down and sent guards to keep me from rebuilding them.,
"Vloxx: Based on everything we know, it can't be stopped. Our only hope is that we're wrong, that an answer lies hidden from us.",
Vloxx: But I intend to win the war.,
Vloxx: Do you understand now? The only hope we can ever have is to be the strongest possible version of ourselves.,
"Vloxx: Finally, there was a way to make a real difference. A tool that could be turned to a better purpose.",
"Vloxx: I tried to do things your way, Commander. And seven hundred innocents drowned because of it.",
Vloxx: I went through the proper channels; I did everything by the book. And they did nothing.,
"Vloxx: If not, there will be unceasing emptiness for all of eternity.",
"Vloxx: In the end, their lives were saved by those who knew better than to be constrained by foolish restrictions.",
"Vloxx: It is not a question of whether we will be besieged again, but only a question of when.",
"Vloxx: So I tried to fix it myself. Tried to build barricades to keep the elementals out, to keep the earth stable.",
Vloxx: So it was with each great tragedy. You witnessed them all and did nothing.,
Vloxx: Someone must!,
"Vloxx: Tell me, wizard, did you have a good view of Elona as Joko swept over it like a cloud of locusts?",
Vloxx: That's why I'm going to change the circumstances.,
Vloxx: The defeat of Bangar did little to discourage those who believed in his ideals.,
"Vloxx: The problem isn't as simple as our leaders. Their ideas outlive them, because the weakness is in us.",
Vloxx: The system put in place to protect us collapsed on contact with real danger.,
"Vloxx: Time itself is against us. Someday, the light will fade forever, reality torn apart at the seams.",
"Vloxx: Unless we are stronger, this story will never change. We will fall right back into the same mistakes.",
Vloxx: We are not strong enough to hold them back forever. Not even you and I.,
Vloxx: Were you satisfied merely that the world wouldn't end? Did it matter that it ended for them?,
"Vloxx: When the ground around the Magus Dam began to shift, I warned them what would happen.",
Vloxx: Where were you when the scarab plague ate them alive? Did their cries of agony reach you in your tower?,
"Vloxx: Yet we do. Over and over and over, to the final moment of time. The cycle ends only when we end it.",
Vloxx: You can continue fighting individual battles if you wish.,
Vloxx: You know what horrors wait out there in the dark. Tyria is beset on all sides.,
