Welcome Back,
Welcome Home,
"Welcome back, %str1%!

Attached to this message you will find several Writs of Experience.

Once you accept the gifts attached to this message, you can find them in your inventory. Double-click the Writ of Experience to consume it and immediately gain 5%% of the XP required to reach the next level.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
"Welcome back, %str1%!

We are thrilled you have been exploring Tyria for a full week! We hope you are enjoying yourself.

Attached to this message you will find a Celebration Booster that will grant you +100%% magic find for 1 hour. Magic find helps you have a better chance at finding high-quality items as loot from slain foes.

The Celebration Booster will also grant you double experience and gold from kills and give you a 10 percent bonus to PvP and WvW reward track progress while it is active.

Thank you for playing Guild Wars 2, and we look forward to hearing the legends of your journey.

—ArenaNet",
"Welcome back, %str1%!

We hope you are enjoying your time in Tyria. Attached to this message you will find a Weapon Selection Box. Selection Boxes allow you to select one item from a number of options.

To open the Selection Box, simply accept the gift attached to this message and double-click the Selection Box in your inventory. You will then be able to select the weapon of your choice. Be sure to select an item that is usable for your profession. That item can then be equipped by double-clicking it in your inventory.

You can see all of your currently equipped gear by visiting the Equipment tab on the Hero panel.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
"Welcome back, %str1%!

We hope you are enjoying your time in Tyria. Attached to this message you will find a ring to help you on your journeys.

Up to two rings can be equipped at once, and each one offers a variety of bonuses that will help you survive the many challenges you will face across Tyria. Double-click this item from your inventory to equip it.

You can see all of your currently equipped gear by visiting the Equipment tab on the Hero panel.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
"Welcome back, %str1%!

We hope you are enjoying your time in Tyria. Attached to this message you will find an amulet to help you on your journeys.

One amulet can be equipped at a time, and each one offers a variety of bonuses that will help you overcome the challenges you will face in Tyria. Double-click this item from your inventory to equip it.

You can see all of your currently equipped gear by visiting the Equipment tab on the Hero panel.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
"Welcome back, %str1%!

We hope you are enjoying your time in Tyria. To help you along in your adventures, we have attached an Experience Booster that will help you gain experience more quickly.

Experience Boosters will increase the experience you gain from defeating enemies, completing quests, and all other activities for 30 minutes. To activate the Experience Booster, accept the gift attached to this message, find it in your inventory, and double-click on the Experience Booster.

Additional boosters can be earned as rewards for completing certain steps on your personal story quest line or purchased directly from the Black Lion Trading Company.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
Welcome to Guild Wars 2,
"Welcome to Guild Wars 2! To help you on your adventures in Tyria, your character has been given a seven-day bonus booster. Enjoy!",
Welcome to Tyria,
"Welcome to Tyria, %str1%!

Attached to this message you will find a token of our appreciation for your decision to embark on your journey across Tyria.

This is an accessory. Up to two accessories can be equipped at once, and each one offers a variety of bonuses that will help you survive the many challenges you will face across Tyria.

Once you accept this gift from this message, you can double-click this item from your inventory to equip it.

You can see all of your currently equipped gear by visiting the Equipment tab on the Hero panel.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
"Welcome to Tyria, %str1%!

Attached to this message you will find a token of our appreciation for your decision to embark on your journey across Tyria. This is a Writ of Experience.

Once you accept the gift attached to this message, you can find it in your inventory. Double-click the Writ of Experience to consume it and immediately gain 5%% of the XP required to reach the next level.

Be sure to check back tomorrow for another gift to help you in your adventures!

—ArenaNet",
